entries[1224897] = { ["name"] = "Voidbound Argentleaf", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nThe silverleaf of Quel'Thalas has grown more lustrous in recent years, gaining a unique sheen that allows anyone to recognize it at a glance. Because of these changes, this new offshoot of silverleaf has become known as argentleaf.\n\nRegularly found among other common foliage, it is a standard ingredient of many recipes and is thus highly sought after.\n\nWhile the power of the void has been present on Azeroth since time immemorial, recent events have caused it to surge. It has managed to seep into the world, which has had adverse affects on the local ecology.\n\nIn some cases, the unstable energies of the void have caused these herbs to be sent across the Twisting Nether to parts unknown. In this case, you happened to find this specimen in the Voidstorm.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes" }
