entries[1225150] = { ["name"] = "Overload Wild Herb", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n5.3 sec cast\nThe lands of Zul'Aman teem with wild nature magic connected with the Loa themselves. By overloading a Wild herb, the herbalist may challenge an Avatar of Halazzi, the Lynx Loa, in combat. Success in this trial results in a temporary but keen increase to Perception.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes" }
