entries[1225245] = { ["name"] = "Sin'dorei Swarmer", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA mixture of crimson and cerulean scales adorns this nimble fish. A common fish in Eversong Woods, the Sin'dorei Swarmer travels and interacts with the waters in accordance to the school it's a part of.\n\nSpecial:\n\nSkillful Chum\n\nThrow this catch back into the water to gain 25 Midnight Fishing for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple catches can extend this buff up to 5 min. Only active in Midnight zones.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n- Zul'Aman\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Bubbling Bloom\n- Sunwell Swarm\n- Surface Ripple\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in open water.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
