entries[1225266] = { ["name"] = "Bloomtail Minnow", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nIts truly unique tail fin resembles that of a flower in bloom. The light emitting from its tail dulls in motion and illuminates when stagnant. Its small size and tendency to travel in schools add a fluorescent motion to the depths of the Harandar.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Harandar\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Lashing Waves\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225267] = { ["name"] = "Hollow Grouper", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA meaty, brutish, bottom feeder that inhabits the depths of Voidstorm's Oceanic Vortexes. Its large mouth allows it to exert minimal effort, sucking in inhabitants in a singular, large motion. Not the most intelligent creature, Hollow Groupers seem to bite at anything remotely resembling food.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Voidstorm\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Oceanic Vortex\n- Viscous Void\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225268] = { ["name"] = "Null Voidfish", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nAn inhabitant of Voidstorm's murky masses. Unsuspecting grey and black scales cover an average-sized fish that seems to exist for the express purpose of existing. Nothing else. Is it even aware that it's been caught?\n\nSpecial:\n\nSalvage\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill can earn Anomaly Filets and other items.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Voidstorm\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Oceanic Vortex\n- Viscous Void\n\nRates:\n- This fish is mostly found in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225269] = { ["name"] = "Root Crab", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA silly crab that finds shelter deep within aquatic root systems. Catching this creature can sometimes stir the surrounding roots, causing more Root Crabs to scurry about.\n\nSpecial:\n\nPerceptive Chum\n\nThrow the catch back into the water to gain 25 Midnight Perception for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple catches can extend this buff up to 5 min.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Harandar\n- Zul'Aman\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Surface Ripple\n- Obscured School\n\nRates:\n- This catch is exceedingly common in open water.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225270] = { ["name"] = "Lynxfish", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nPlayful whiskers cover the face of the Lynxfish. A slender frame and powerful tail allow for this fish to pounce on its prey similarly to its namesake.\n\nSpecial:\n\nSkillful Chum\n\nThrow this catch back into the water to gain 25 Midnight Fishing for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple catches can extend this buff up to 5 min. Only active in Midnight zones.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n- Zul'Aman\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Bubbling Bloom\n- Sunwell Swarm\n- Surface Ripple\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in open water.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225271] = { ["name"] = "Shimmersiren", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA twilight sparkle in the otherwise inky-black depths of Voidstorm's fishable masses. Fishlike in nature, but its origin is off-putting enough to cross the line between fish, or something else.\n\nSpecial:\n\nGut\n\nShimmersiren guts can contain Bloomlines and Glimmerlines used to empower your fishing rod.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Voidstorm\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Oceanic Vortex\n- Viscous Void\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225272] = { ["name"] = "Shimmer Spinefish", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA stalwart silver spinefish whose body encourages Anglers and fish alike to explore before jutting its coarse spines in their direction. A beautifully grumpy friend to no-one, but a welcome treasure for any aspiring Angler.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n- Harandar\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Bubbling Bloom\n- Sunwell Swarm\n- Bloom Swarm\n- Blossoming Torrent\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225273] = { ["name"] = "Ominous Octopus", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA curiously off-putting denizen of Voidstorm. Its limbs extend from the fishable aspects of the void. Cunning, crafty, intelligent, and a formidable challenge to any Angler brave enough to fish in Voidstorm.\n\nSpecial:\n\nCooking Feasts\n\nThis especially rare and tasty fish is an important ingredient in many Midnight Cooking recipes.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Voidstorm\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Oceanic Vortex\n- Viscous Void\n\nRates:\n- This creature is mostly found in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225274] = { ["name"] = "Blood Hunter", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nBlood red with scales angled for speed and brutality. A creature built on the thrill of the hunt so much so that its spirit has been known to hunt the very Anglers that reel it from the waters of Zul'Aman. A gloriously dangerous reminder to keep your wits about you.\n\nSpecial:\n\nBlood Hunter Spirit\n\nCatching a Blood Hunter has a chance for their spirit to come back for revenge. Fight off the spirit for bonus loot! Luring Blood Hunters increases this chance.\n\nThis is also a commonly used fish for Midnight Cooking Feasts.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Zul'Aman\n- Voidstorm\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Surface Ripple\n- Hunter Surge\n\nRates:\n- This fish is mostly found in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225275] = { ["name"] = "Gore Guppy", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nSmall, cute, and exceptionally dangerous. A bubbly unsuspecting body houses sets of sharp serrated fangs designed to quickly rip flesh and escape with the meal. Its messy eating habits create a feeding ground for surrounding Blood Hunters.\n\nSpecial:\n\nSkillful Chum\n\nThrow this catch back into the water to gain 25 Midnight Fishing for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple catches can extend this buff up to 5 min. Only active in Midnight zones.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Zul'Aman\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Surface Ripple\n- Hunter Surge\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in open water.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225276] = { ["name"] = "Fungalskin Pike", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nAbstract scales of varying sizes, shapes, and colors give this Pike its fungal name. A large menacing body exerts a commanding presence over its territory and offer a particularly challenging catch for Anglers.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Zul'Aman\n- Harandar\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Surface Ripple\n- Obscured School\n- Lashing Waves\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225277] = { ["name"] = "Restored Songfish", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nWaters in Harandar contain unique minerals that, when passing through the gills of a Restored Songfish, emit an ethereal underwater melody. This song, while pleasant to an Angler, wards off predators with its subtle vibration. If a predator, such as the Twisted Tetra, gets too close, the vibrations grow more volatile.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n- Harandar\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Bloom Swarm\n- Bubbling Bloom\n- Sunwell Swarm\n- Blossoming Torrent\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225278] = { ["name"] = "Sunwell Fish", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nVibrant, regal, and poised. When moving throughout the waters of the Eversong Woods, its body glows marking its location on the surface of the water. Surrounding fish find themselves drawn to the light of the Sunwell Fish, but the greater question for Anglers is if the Sunwell Fish will be drawn to their line?\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Sunwell Swarm\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225279] = { ["name"] = "Warping Wise", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA maliciously playful inhabitant of the void. Its deep attunement with the void allows it to warp between worlds in search of new fish to consume. Holding this fish has the chance to take Anglers along for the ride.\n\nSpecial:\n\nWhimsical Warp\n\nAgitate the Warping Wise, teleporting you.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Voidstorm\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Oceanic Vortex\n- Viscous Void\n\nRates:\n- This fish is mostly found in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225280] = { ["name"] = "Twisted Tetra", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nAn eel whose body camouflages within the roots that make up the riverbeds of the Harandar. The Twisted Tetra lies in wait for Bloomtail Minnows who become too comfortable with their surroundings.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Harandar\n- Zul'Aman\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Obscured School\n- Lashing Waves\n\nRates:\n- This fish is mostly found in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225281] = { ["name"] = "Tender Lumifin", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nA gentle creature who prefers the calm waters of Eversong Woods. While the waters may be straightforward for your average Angler to cast, this particular fish is only available to the most perceptive of them.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill will produce Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n- Harandar\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Blossoming Torrent\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225282] = { ["name"] = "Arcane Wyrmfish", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nThe Arcane Wyrmfish empowers its translucent fins through its absorption of latent arcane magic imbued in minerals and decaying life that might linger in nearby waters.\n\nSpecial:\n\nPerceptive Chum\n\nThrow the catch back into the water to gain 25 Midnight Perception for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple catches can extend this buff up to 5 min.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n- Harandar\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Bubbling Bloom\n- Sunwell Swarm\n- Blossoming Torrent\n\nRates:\n- This fish is exceedingly common in open water.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225283] = { ["name"] = "Eversong Trout", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nAn elegant amalgamation of everything the Eversong Woods embody. Seemingly designed to perfection, it is both bountiful in the Eversong waters and as a food source. Rounded lines taper across its slender body perfectly resembling Blood Elf architecture.\n\nSpecial:\n\nFresh Fillet\n\nSalvaging this fish with the Cooking skill can produce a large amount of Fresh Fillet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Eversong Woods\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Sunwell Swarm\n- Bubbling Bloom\n- Bloom Swarm\n\nRates:\n- This fish is mostly found in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
entries[1225284] = { ["name"] = "Lucky Loa", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nAnglin' Score: points.\n\nCatch Rank: Guppy\n\nDescription:\nThe most elusive fish in Zul'Aman, its godlike status makes it a particularly ambitious prize. An ephemeral teal aura radiates from its gills, nullifying the deadly Blood Hunters inhabiting the surrounding waters. The Lucky Loa sits atop the food chain in the waters of Zul'Aman, and it knows it.\n\nSpecial:\n\nCooking Feasts\n\nThis especially rare and tasty fish is an important ingredient in many Midnight Cooking recipes.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n- Zul'Aman\n\nFishing Pools:\n- Surface Ripple\n- Obscured School\n\nRates:\n- This fish is mostly found in pools.\nDiscovery:\nFishing" }
