entries[1225817] = { ["name"] = "Overload Primal Deposits", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nChanneling Primal magic lets the miner give some of their life force in exchange for overloading the deposit and accessing more resources.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes" }
entries[1225818] = { ["name"] = "Overload Lightfused Deposits", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nOverloading Lightfused ore deposits causes a burst of luminous energy that coalesces and pours from the sky, ready to be caught.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes" }
entries[1225819] = { ["name"] = "Overload Wild Deposits", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nOverloading a Wild ore deposit will challenge an Avatar of Nalorakk, the Bear Loa, to a duel. Should you succeed, the Avatar will grant a boon to your Perception for a limited time. Should you fail...best not to think about that.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes" }
entries[1225820] = { ["name"] = "Overload Voidbound Deposits", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nIntroduce more entropy to an already fragile deposit, creating a catastrophic reaction where reality collapses in on itself. Chunks of ore materialize nearby, enabling particularly quick miners to gain additional materials.\n\nThere is also a fracture in reality left behind--who knows where you'll end up if you step through it?\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes" }
